# unit_conversion_neuron.nestml
# #############################
#
# Description
# +++++++++++
#
# This model is used to check that values with a physical unit are converted once when they are assigned, added, multiplied, raised to a power, compared or passed in a different unit.
#
#
# Copyright statement
# +++++++++++++++++++
#
# This file is part of NEST.
#
